<title>POLAND: Polish Commercial Q1 net up to PLN 15 mln.</title>
<headline>Polish Commercial Q1 net up to PLN 15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Britain's Commercial Union Plc insurance firm raised its first quarter net profit to 15.2 million zlotys from 3.5 million in the first quarter of 1996, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said its gros premiums rose to 131.3 million zlotys in the first quarter this year, from 58.5 million zlotys in the same period last year.</p>
<p>It said its revenues from investments rose to 16.6 million zlotys in the first quarter of 1997 from 5.3 million in the first quarter of last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
